      "reasons": [
        "The packet only states that the AI “functions as a catalyst for self-regulated learning rather than a passive crutch,” but it does not define what a “crutch” means (e.g., relying passively in place of one’s own learning/self-regulation processes).",
        "The definition’s contrast with “a scaffold” as strengthening “planning, monitoring, and independent problem solving” is not explicitly supported in the packet; the packet mentions planning/monitoring/regulation processes in general measurement terms, but does not provide the requested scaffold definition or the specific contrast wording.",
